# Example environment file. Copy to .env.local and fill in.
# .env.local is gitignored and must never be committed.
#
# Cues has no application code yet, so no variables are defined.
# The design is offline-first: on-device speech and a local model, with
# no cloud inference in the runtime path. If a build-time key is ever
# needed (for example a model download mirror), declare it here first.
